whenever you're faced with an important  business decision  tap into your core values and remember  why you started this business  before you make a decision otherwise you  could take on a deal or opportunity that  you'll regret for the rest of your life  hi i'm evan carmichael i believe that  hungry entrepreneurs deserve help  and i got a question from one of my  youtube viewers thank you youtube guys  named ricky who had a question about  business expansion he wrote in to say hi  evan  i have a small produce stand i sell  things like corn tomatoes cucumbers i  love this business but i can't think of  any way of expanding it  i'm unsure of how i could possibly make  more money and grow this small roadside  stand into a bigger business  thank you for reading i really  appreciate your informative videos ricky  thanks for the question and congrats  on on what you've done so far for  reaching out but you didn't tell me  anything about  what's unique about your business what  makes you special  you start off saying i have a small  produce stand i sell things as corn  tomatoes cucumbers it's boring  there's tons of those guys you want to  expand your business you have to know  what sets you apart  for me to give you advice i have to know  what's different about you  what you stand for what makes you unique  there's a lot of ways to grow this  business  you could create your own product line  you could try to launch a retail retail  store  you could have multiple stands on  different roads  there's a lot of ways to grow this but i  don't know what makes you special  and why you started this business  whenever you're faced with an important  business growth opportunity  and there's multiple ways to go and  you're confused  the clarity comes from looking at why  you started your business and what your  core values are  i'll give you a quick example companies  come to me all the time wanting me to  to represent them to pitch their  products  and most of the time i say no because i  don't use your product  and these are companies that you would  recognize i'm not going to name names  but brand name companies that you would  recognize  call me up and say evan we love what  you're doing we're trying to reach more  entrepreneurs  we want you to say our company is the  greatest and pitch our product  this is an easy decision for me my core  value is i love helping entrepreneurs  right you hear  at the beginning of my videos i believe  that hungry entrepreneurs deserve help  if what i'm doing isn't helping  entrepreneurs i'm not going to feel good  about it  even if it makes me a lot of money i'm  not going to do it because i'm not going  to feel good about it and the end result  is not going to be great  so no i will not pitch your product even  if you're throwing a ton of cash at me  because i don't think it's going to help  people  if i can't firmly stand behind it then  i'm not going to pitch it  and so back to this business growth  opportunity there's a lot of ways to  grow it  and you should be thinking beyond just  one little location  if it's multiple locations if it's a  retail store if you're starting a home  delivery business  whatever it is lots of ways to grow it  but what makes you special  you cannot just be a little side store  on the side of the street selling  cucumbers and corn  there has to be something different and  i think there's there you know every  entrepreneur has that within them  but they don't let it come out they  don't share it they don't put everything  they have into it they don't communicate  that message with people  and as a result you get lost you're just  another guy doing the same thing as  everybody else  every time you're communicating what you  do to anybody  so when ricky's writing into me he  should be writing that right anytime you  write an email to somebody  you got to say what makes you special so  ricky work on it  write back to me i want to hear your new  pitch i don't want to hear  you just have a small produce stand  okay and then from there we can talk  about how to grow this business  i believe you have something there and i  think every entrepreneur has that within  them  they just don't do a good job of  recognizing themselves  and putting it into every piece of  communication that you do  good luck for those of you watching you  like the video please give it a thumbs  up below and i'd love to hear from you  please leave a comment under this video  it makes my morning every time when i  see them come in  so thank you guys and i'll see you on  the next episode
 

